import{_ as t,o as a,c as o,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 221 | Dao Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Dao-Rule Condensation and Personal Great Dao Prototype","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 221 | Dao Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Dao-Rule Condensation and Personal Great Dao Prototype","no":221,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Dao Origin Realm","Supplement","Dao-Rule Condensation","Personal Great Dao"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","02-Anchor Origin Definition and Essence","11-Deduction Iteration System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0221_模块1-道元境补遗-道则凝聚与个人大道雏形.md","filePath":"en/0221_模块1-道元境补遗-道则凝聚与个人大道雏形.md"}'),n={name:"en/0221_模块1-道元境补遗-道则凝聚与个人大道雏形.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,d,c){return a(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-221-dao-origin-realm-deep-supplement-dao-rule-condensation-and-personal-great-dao-prototype" tabindex="-1">Entry 221 | Dao Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Dao-Rule Condensation and Personal Great Dao Prototype <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-221-dao-origin-realm-deep-supplement-dao-rule-condensation-and-personal-great-dao-prototype" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 221 | Dao Origin Realm Deep Supplement: Dao-Rule Condensation and Personal Great Dao Prototype&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 02, 11</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-from-understanding-laws-to-my-dao" tabindex="-1">Introduction: From &quot;understanding laws&quot; to &quot;my Dao&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-from-understanding-laws-to-my-dao" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: From &quot;understanding laws&quot; to &quot;my Dao&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos)&#39;s Dao Origin Realm is the five mortal-cultivation realms&#39; apex. Law Origin cultivators &quot;heard&quot; laws; Dao Origin cultivators must answer a more fundamental question: <strong>which road will I take using these laws?</strong> This is &quot;attaining Dao&quot; — from understanding the cosmos&#39;s laws to forming one&#39;s own personal great Dao prototype. Dao Origin Realm is not &quot;understanding more laws,&quot; but &quot;integrating understood laws into a system of one&#39;s own.&quot;</p><p>The six top-level axioms run through Dao Origin equally: the anti-predation axiom requires personal Dao to be based on creation not predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires every Myriad Race to have &quot;Dao-attainment&quot; qualification and path; the collective ascension axiom requires personal Dao ultimately serve Myriad Races; the causal self-discipline axiom constrains personal Dao not interfere with others&#39; karma; the law-first axiom ensures Dao-rule condensation&#39;s law definitions are stable, not retconned by faction disputes; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This entry deep-dives Dao Origin&#39;s core lesson: what is &quot;Dao-rule condensation&quot;? How does the personal great Dao prototype form? What is its fundamental difference from Dao Integration&#39;s &quot;integrating with Dao&quot;?</p><h2 id="i-three-meanings-of-dao-rule-condensation" tabindex="-1">I. Three Meanings of Dao-Rule Condensation <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-meanings-of-dao-rule-condensation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Meanings of Dao-Rule Condensation&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-what-is-dao-rule" tabindex="-1">1.1 What Is &quot;Dao-Rule&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-what-is-dao-rule" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 What Is &quot;Dao-Rule&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Dao Origin&#39;s &quot;Dao-rules&quot; are not cosmic laws themselves, but <strong>core principles the cultivator distills from laws, guiding their own cultivation and practice</strong>. If laws are &quot;how the cosmos runs,&quot; Dao-rules are &quot;how I act accordingly.&quot;</p><p>Dao-rule condensation&#39;s process is essentially taking law information perceived since Law Origin, through one&#39;s own understanding, filtering, integration, distilling into a few core principles. These principles are not taught by others, but &quot;grown&quot; by the cultivator&#39;s own cultivation experience.</p><h3 id="_1-2-three-stages-of-dao-rule-condensation" tabindex="-1">1.2 Three Stages of Dao-Rule Condensation <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-three-stages-of-dao-rule-condensation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Three Stages of Dao-Rule Condensation&quot;">​</a></h3><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Stage</th><th>Name</th><th>Feature</th><th>Output</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Stage 1</td><td>Law accumulation</td><td>Broadly perceiving laws in various fields</td><td>Law knowledge library</td></tr><tr><td>Stage 2</td><td>Law filtering</td><td>Filtering core laws per own endowment</td><td>Core law set (3-7 items)</td></tr><tr><td>Stage 3</td><td>Dao-rule distillation</td><td>Sublimating core laws into personal Dao-rules</td><td>Personal great Dao prototype</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>Stage 1 law accumulation</strong> is Dao Origin&#39;s foundation. Cultivators do not rush to &quot;attain Dao,&quot; but broadly perceive laws across multiple fields — combat laws, life laws, space laws, time laws, karma laws (observation level), etc. The broader the accumulation, the more choices.</p><p><strong>Stage 2 law filtering</strong> requires the cultivator to filter 3-7 core laws most fitting them from accumulated laws, per own endowment, interest, social responsibility. The filtering standard is not &quot;which is strongest,&quot; but &quot;which fits me best&quot; — this filtering usually requires mentor and anchor network assistance.</p><p><strong>Stage 3 Dao-rule distillation</strong> is Dao Origin&#39;s core. The cultivator distills filtered core laws into their own Dao-rules — not copying laws verbatim, but expressing them in own language, own practice way. Once Dao-rules are distilled, they become the guiding principles for all subsequent cultivation and practice.</p><h2 id="ii-features-of-the-personal-great-dao-prototype" tabindex="-1">II. Features of the Personal Great Dao Prototype <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-features-of-the-personal-great-dao-prototype" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Features of the Personal Great Dao Prototype&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao Origin&#39;s &quot;personal great Dao&quot; is still a prototype, not a complete &quot;Dao.&quot; It has the following features:</p><ul><li><strong>Core clear</strong>: 3-7 core Dao-rules, clearly expressed</li><li><strong>Practically verifiable</strong>: Dao-rules are not empty talk, but repeatedly verified in cultivation practice</li><li><strong>Open evolution</strong>: the prototype allows evolution and correction as cultivation deepens</li><li><strong>Non-exclusivity</strong>: personal great Dao does not exclude others&#39; Dao, Myriad Races each have their own</li><li><strong>Symbiosis-oriented</strong>: in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, personal great Dao must be compatible with symbiotic ideals</li></ul><h3 id="example-dao-rules-a-space-law-direction-cultivator-s-dao-rule-prototype" tabindex="-1">Example Dao-rules (a space-law-direction cultivator&#39;s Dao-rule prototype): <a class="header-anchor" href="#example-dao-rules-a-space-law-direction-cultivator-s-dao-rule-prototype" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Example Dao-rules (a space-law-direction cultivator&#39;s Dao-rule prototype):&quot;">​</a></h3><ol><li>Space is not a container, but laws&#39; fabric — can be understood, can be woven</li><li>Every inch of space has its texture; following the texture yields twice the result with half the effort</li><li>Opening space is not destruction, but &quot;growing&quot; new parts on the existing fabric</li><li>The space Dao&#39;s ultimate goal is to let Myriad Races flow freely in space</li></ol><h2 id="iii-the-divide-between-dao-origin-and-dao-integration" tabindex="-1">III. The Divide Between Dao Origin and Dao Integration <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-divide-between-dao-origin-and-dao-integration" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Divide Between Dao Origin and Dao Integration&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao Origin&#39;s personal great Dao is a &quot;prototype&quot;; Dao Integration&#39;s great Dao is &quot;fused with the cosmos.&quot; The two differ in:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Dao Origin Realm</th><th>Dao Integration Realm</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Dao state</td><td>Personal prototype</td><td>Deep fusion with cosmic laws</td></tr><tr><td>Law relationship</td><td>Using laws</td><td>Being laws</td></tr><tr><td>Influence range</td><td>Personal domain</td><td>Larger-scope rewriting of local laws</td></tr><tr><td>Life form</td><td>Material-dominant</td><td>Beginning high-dimensionalization</td></tr><tr><td>Assessment requirement</td><td>Dao-rule prototype clear</td><td>Dao heart in sync with cosmic symbiotic laws</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The key difference is: Dao Origin&#39;s Dao is &quot;my Dao&quot;; Dao Integration&#39;s Dao is &quot;my Dao is the cosmic Dao.&quot; From &quot;my Dao&quot; to &quot;my Dao is the cosmic Dao,&quot; a thorough Dao-heart sublimation is needed in between — this is precisely why breaking through to Dao Integration is a cosmic-level event.</p><h2 id="iv-common-obstacles-to-dao-origin-breakthrough" tabindex="-1">IV. Common Obstacles to Dao Origin Breakthrough <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-common-obstacles-to-dao-origin-breakthrough" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Common Obstacles to Dao Origin Breakthrough&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Vague Dao-rules</strong>: cannot distill clear Dao-rules, cultivation practice lacks guidance</li><li><strong>Narrow Dao-rules</strong>: only choosing combat laws, neglecting life, karma and other dimensions, causing late-stage Dao-heart narrowness</li><li><strong>Exclusive Dao-rules</strong>: believing own Dao is &quot;uniquely correct,&quot; excluding others&#39; Dao — directly conflicts with the republican axiom of Myriad Races</li><li><strong>Rigid Dao-rules</strong>: treating Dao-rules as uncorrectable dogma, refusing to evolve as cultivation deepens</li><li><strong>Predatory Dao-rules</strong>: Dao-rules built on predatory experience (e.g., &quot;the strong must devour the weak&quot;), reject symbiotic laws</li></ul><p>The anchor network has specialized identification and guidance mechanisms for these obstacles, ensuring Dao Origin cultivators&#39; Dao-rules take the right path.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Dao-rule condensation avoids the waste of &quot;cultivating everything, excelling at nothing&quot; — with core Dao-rules, cultivation resources concentrate on core directions</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: Dao-rules must be based on symbiotic ideals; the Predatory Faction&#39;s &quot;Dao&quot; will reveal its rejection at Dao Origin, cannot truly distill</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems&#39; cultivators have no concept of &quot;attaining Dao,&quot; all abilities come from external soul rings; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Dao Origin cultivators have their own Dao-rules, fundamentally transcending the &quot;being equipped&quot; mode</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: every Myriad Races group has its own Dao-rule condensation path, plant spirits&#39; Dao, planetary consciousness&#39;s Dao, mechanical life&#39;s Dao each have features</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Dao-rule distillation methods and ten thousand personal great Dao prototype cases are all openly shared, paving the way for Dao Integration → Boundary-Breaking → higher realms</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao Origin Realm is the five mortal-cultivation realms&#39; closing piece. In this realm, the cultivator finally turns from &quot;learning laws&quot; to &quot;having my own Dao.&quot; In predatory-faction systems, cultivators spend their whole lives &quot;collecting equipment&quot; (soul rings, bloodline, magical treasures), never forming their own Dao; in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, Dao Origin cultivators have their own Dao-rule prototype — this is not only power&#39;s maturity, but also personality and thought&#39;s maturity. Attaining Dao is not becoming stronger, but becoming more complete.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dao Origin Realm supplement · Dao-rule condensation and personal great Dao prototype described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./02-锚点本源定义与本质.html">02-Anchor Origin Definition and Essence</a> · <a href="./11-推演迭代体系详解.html">11-Deduction Iteration System</a></li></ul>',34)])])}const p=t(n,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
